# Story and acceptance criteria format

- One story per file: `docs/requirements/stories/<slug>.md`
- Front matter: `jira` (key or blank), `epic`, `epic_key` (blank until synced), `status` (`draft` | `in-progress` | `done`), `version` (start at 1; add 1 whenever the AC change), `last_synced`
- Story line: `As a <role>, I want <capability>, so that <benefit>`
- Acceptance criteria: numbered AC1, AC2… in Given / When / Then form
- Each AC must be testable; no words like "fast" or "easy" without a number
- Add an "Open questions" section instead of guessing
